Terus, orang Tata Usaha itu baik, ya.

515
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,399
Dia bantu macam-macam.

516
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,949
Akhirnya beres juga.

517
00:20:20,950 --> 00:20:22,820
Ya, sepertinya begitu.

518
00:20:23,580 --> 00:20:25,859
Terus, yang tadi itu apa?

519
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:27,380
Musim dingin kenapa?

520
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:31,620
Itu haiku karya Takahama Kyoshi.

521
00:20:31,950 --> 00:20:35,380
Yah, artinya dingin dan sepi.

522
00:20:37,090 --> 00:20:37,460
TAP

523
00:20:38,150 --> 00:20:38,860
Hm?

524
00:20:39,690 --> 00:20:40,870
Sini.

525
00:20:43,110 --> 00:20:44,649
Hangat?

526
00:20:44,650 --> 00:20:46,019
Ah, iya.

527
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:47,969
Tidak kesepian?

528
00:20:47,970 --> 00:20:48,780
Iya.

529
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:51,679
Belakangan kulit di pinggir kukuku
sering terkelupas.

530
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,680
Makan sayur yang benar, dong.

531
00:20:54,010 --> 00:20:55,809
Kerja bagus.

532
00:20:55,810 --> 00:20:57,899
Hari ini dingin, ya.

533
00:20:57,900 --> 00:20:59,900
Eh? Walah, walah.

534
00:21:00,010 --> 00:21:01,700
Kerja bagus.

535
00:21:01,820 --> 00:21:03,939
Tadi aku bilang dingin, jadinya begini.

536
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:05,410
Lagi menghangatkan.

537
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,410
Begitu, ya.

538
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,520
Kalau begitu, aku juga...

539
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:15,340
Memang hangat dan menyenangkan, ya.

540
00:21:15,650 --> 00:21:17,309
Anu... Kok dekat?

541
00:21:17,310 --> 00:21:18,829
Kenapa, goyang...?

542
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:22,120
Seru, ya, oshikura manju.

543
00:21:22,310 --> 00:21:24,219
Dari dulu aku ingin mencobanya.

544
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:26,220
Tak kusangka bisa di umur sebegini.

545
00:21:26,230 --> 00:21:28,460
Eh, bukan, ini...

546
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,160
Ya.

547
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:33,340
Tangan Ume dingin, ya.

548
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:35,890
Bukan, Michinoku yang hangat.

549
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:39,059
Walah, tanganku juga hangat, lo.

550
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:40,189
Mau coba?

551
00:21:40,190 --> 00:21:40,970
Eh?

552
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:42,690
Wah, bagian itu...

553
00:21:42,820 --> 00:21:43,810
- Permisi.
- Ayo, ayo...

554
00:21:43,850 --> 00:21:45,610
Aduh, dingin!

555
00:21:46,210 --> 00:21:48,020
Wah, akhirnya!

556
00:21:48,190 --> 00:21:51,100
Oalah, kukira bakal dicekik.

557
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:52,759
Hei, tidak sopan.

558
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:54,540
Ikutan.

559
00:21:54,990 --> 00:21:56,539
Tapi, ya, soal tangan,

560
00:21:56,540 --> 00:21:59,579
katanya orang yang tangannya dingin
hatinya hangat, lo.

561
00:21:59,580 --> 00:22:00,040
Mm!

562
00:22:00,220 --> 00:22:01,990
Lagi-lagi ngomong yang tidak perlu.

563
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:05,410
Berarti orang yang tangannya hangat?

564
00:22:05,530 --> 00:22:07,319
Hatinya hangat.

565
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:08,620
Teori kebaikan bawaan manusia.

566
00:22:10,170 --> 00:22:12,439
Saljunya makin deras, ya.

567
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,359
Makin dingin.

568
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:16,360
Kalau begitu, kita lakukan lagi?

569
00:22:17,580 --> 00:22:18,140
Ya.

570
00:22:18,710 --> 00:22:20,839
Semuanya! Ada salju!

571
00:22:20,840 --> 00:22:21,990
Ayo keluar sebentar...

572
00:22:23,460 --> 00:22:25,390
Ka-Kalian semua lagi ngapain?

573
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:28,269
Seperti yang terlihat, oshikura manju.

574
00:22:28,270 --> 00:22:29,430
Begitulah.

575
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:31,909
Eh? Bagian mananya?

576
00:22:31,910 --> 00:22:34,740
Hari ini dingin,
jadi kami menghangatkan diri.

577
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:37,889
Anak ekskul olahraga
kan suka lari-lari di dalam ini.

578
00:22:37,890 --> 00:22:39,090
Bodoh, ya.

579
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,650
Betul.

580
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,860
Meleset.

581
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,770
Akrab sekali, ya.

582
00:22:57,570 --> 00:22:59,560
Ketua tidak mau ikut juga?

583
00:23:00,710 --> 00:23:02,580
Be-Begitu, ya?

584
00:23:03,170 --> 00:23:06,440
Ka-Kalau begitu, permisi, ya.

585
00:23:10,770 --> 00:23:12,309
Hangat, ya.

586
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:13,180
Ya, 'kan?

587
00:23:13,420 --> 00:23:14,190
Ya.

588
00:23:22,520 --> 00:23:24,380
Sial, dingin banget.

589
00:23:25,100 --> 00:23:27,160
Saljunya menumpuk, ya.

590
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:28,849
Rasakan!

591
00:23:28,850 --> 00:23:29,600
Wah!

592
00:23:29,730 --> 00:23:30,880
Awas, ya!

593
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:32,799
Apa, apa?

594
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:33,929
Semangat sekali, ya.

595
00:23:33,930 --> 00:23:34,730
Ya.

596
00:23:34,970 --> 00:23:35,969
CUPLIKAN EPISODE BERIKUTNYA

597
00:23:35,970 --> 00:23:38,069
KOMARO DAN KEBUN BINATANG,
ALICE IN NO-BRA LAND

598
00:23:38,070 --> 00:23:39,980
NANTIKAN EPISODE BERIKUTNYA, YA!

